1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,130
At the left we can see...

2
00:00:08,130 --> 00:00:10,500
At the right we can see the...

3
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:11,980
...the head-snarlers.

4
00:00:11,980 --> 00:00:14,550
Everything is safe... Perfectly safe.

5
00:00:14,550 --> 00:00:15,770
Emo?

6
00:00:16,120 --> 00:00:17,220
Emo?

7
00:00:18,620 --> 00:00:20,104
Watch out!

8
00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:38,260
Are you hurt?

9
00:00:41,990 --> 00:00:44,200
I don't think so. You?

10
00:00:45,520 --> 00:00:47,090
I'm OK.

11
00:00:47,090 --> 00:00:51,110
Get up, Emo! It's not safe here.

12
00:00:52,030 --> 00:00:53,229
Let's go.

13
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:55,190
What's next?

14
00:00:55,190 --> 00:00:56,960
You'll see!

15
00:00:57,680 --> 00:00:58,840
You'll see!

16
00:01:06,030 --> 00:01:08,480
Emo! This way.

17
00:01:24,230 --> 00:01:25,480
Follow me!
